  "body": "Fix Codex channels that kept reporting \"Automatic renewal is unavailable. Reauthorize this account; its current token remains usable until it expires or is rejected.\" during the first import after CCLOAD_ENABLE_SQLITE_REPLICA=1 was enabled.\n\nImport now carries over the primary's existing refresh history: completed records are reused so restored credentials renew normally, and channels without an entry claim once. It only fills records missing locally, never overwrites local records, and imported pending records stay blocked from replay.",
